1. Retrieve All Accounts with Their Related Contacts Who Have Not Logged In for 90+ Days

-> [SELECT Account.Name,
       Name,
       Email,
       LastLoginDate
FROM Contact
WHERE LastLoginDate <= LAST_N_DAYS:90];


==>If you also want Account fields, but only for those that have such Contacts:
[SELECT Id,Name,
        (SELECT Email,LastModifiedDate  FROM CONTACTS WHERE LastModifiedDate  <= LAST_N_DAYS :90)
  FROM ACCOUNT
        WHERE Id IN 
        (SELECT AccountId FROM Contact WHERE LastModifiedDate  <= LAST_N_DAYS : 90)]

==>If Login Info is Stored on User Object 

SELECT Account.Name,
       Name,
       Email,
       (SELECT Username, LastLoginDate FROM Users WHERE LastLoginDate <= LAST_N_DAYS:90)
FROM Contact
WHERE Id IN (
    SELECT ContactId FROM User WHERE LastLoginDate <= LAST_N_DAYS:90
)

